WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
If this is your prep, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:10.080
Just follow along step by step. Your prep contains three packets, one Mango

3
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:10.960
flavored packet,

4
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.940
and two Fruit Punch packets. You'll also need the mixing container that comes

5
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:15.360
with it,

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:22.080
and water. Start with your first dose. This is the Mango packet, and you'll

7
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:22.480
take it the

8
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.260
evening before your procedure. Open the Mango packet and pour it into the

9
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.040
container.

10
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:33.110
Add 16 ounces of water up to the fill line. Shake or stir it until it's

11
00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:33.840
completely dissolved.

12
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:40.230
Now take your time. Slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes. There's no rush.

13
00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:40.640
Just keep

14
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:45.370
sipping steadily. Once you've finished, refill the same container or a 16-ounce

15
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.240
cup with water.

16
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.440
Drink this glass of water within 30 minutes too.

17
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:58.540
Your second dose happens 12 hours after the first. This time you'll use both

18
00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.520
Fruit Punch packets.

19
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.000
Open both Fruit Punch packets and pour them into the container.

20
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.320
Add water to the 16-ounce fill line and shake or stir until dissolved.

21
00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:12.720
Just like before, slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes.

22
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:17.280
Then refill the container with 16 ounces of water and finish that within 30

23
00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:17.440
minutes.

24
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.560
The timing of this second dose is really important.

25
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.390
Make sure you take it at the right time so your prep is as effective as

26
00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:25.120
possible.

27
00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.680
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed,

28
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:31.440
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

29
00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.560
but finishing the entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your

30
00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.040
procedure.

31
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.330
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

32
00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.160
of us wants that.

33
00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:44.310
After you've finished each dose, keep drinking clear liquids throughout the

34
00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:44.720
evening.

35
00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:48.480
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job.

36
00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:52.720
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom,

37
00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:56.640
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

38
00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:02.020
That's it, you've got this. Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay

39
00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:02.560
hydrated.

40
00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:07.210
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office. We're here

41
00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:07.760
to help.
